        "original_id": "c2080294-f165-59f8-9a1a-732675fafb5c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Liz Rose, Taylor Swift, Pat McLaughlin, Gary Allan\n- Songs: \"White Horse,\" \"Teardrops on My Guitar,\" \"You Belong with Me,\" \"Songs About Rain\"\n- Companies: Big Machine Records\n- Albums: Swift's eponymous debut album\n- Awards: Grammy Award\n\nFacts:\n- \"Teardrops on My Guitar\" was released on February 19, 2007, by Big Machine Records as the second single from Taylor Swift's eponymous debut album.\n- In 2010, Liz Rose and Taylor Swift won a Grammy Award for \"You Belong with Me.\"\n- Liz Rose has co-written twenty of Taylor Swift's officially released songs and singles, including \"White Horse,\" \"Teardrops on My Guitar,\" and \"You Belong with Me.\"\n- \"Songs About Rain\" was written by Pat McLaughlin and Liz Rose and was recorded by American country music artist Gary Allan.",
